OL,4,G2145FThe Essay: Scotland Rocks
OL,5,     GKenneth Steven explores the
OL,6,     Ghistory of this semi-precious
OL,7,     Gstone and reflects in poetry on
OL,8,     Ghis finds. The first stone he
OL,9,     Gfound was serpentine from the
OL,10,     Gbeaches of the island of Iona.
OL,11,G2200FNight Tracks
